<title>EGYPT: T. Hoare and Co make alliance with Egypt broker.</title>
<headline>T. Hoare and Co make alliance with Egypt broker.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>International stockbrokers T. Hoare and Co said in a statement on Monday it had formed a strategic alliance with Egyptian brokers Triple A Securities.</p>
<p>T. Hoare and Co. is a member of the London Stock Exchange and has offices in London and Paris. Triple A Securities is a member of the Cairo Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
